				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Whitney</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5252186</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Never in my life have I read something as truly life changing as this. This truly out performs some of the greatest writings of the Century. From the start I was truly hooked and on the edge of my seat. I paced the room several times in order to gather myself for the truly mind bending nature of what I was about to read! Not to mention the surrealistic hand drawn image that really humanized the Scp and allowed me to truly feel for the character as a whole!</p> <p>I truly can not wait to see more of your work keep it up and you will be the next Shakespeare&#8230;. No your better than that!</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
